ared","excluded_units":[],"id":"p002","included_unit_count":0,"order":2,"source":{"height":1639,"image_uri":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/Harvard_drs_428685616_%E7%81%BD%E9%9A%BE%E4%B9%8B%E7%94%B1.pdf#page=2","sha256":"e02b6431b1c4e5afc9c71abed71bf72ed3bda80e30d55771e2f97329f4875ed2","uri":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File:Harvard_drs_428685616_%E7%81%BD%E9%9A%BE%E4%B9%8B%E7%94%B1.pdf&oldid=1293876361","width":2400}}],"schema":"harvard-drs-428685616-transcription/1","units":[{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u001","layer":"paratext","order":1,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"paratext","text":"災難之由","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u002","layer":"body","order":2,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"上帝一大父也、父於子無不愛、上帝於人亦無不愛、然而飢寒者不免危難者","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u003","layer":"body","order":3,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"不堪、斯亦慘矣、而又兵戈以戕之、瘟疫以戕之、旱乾水溢以戕之、死者血流尸","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["又","叉"],"length":1,"offset":9,"reason":"刻形近似「叉」，按文例錄作「又」；本頁其他「又」字同此情形"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u004","layer":"body","order":4,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"積、生者東奔西馳、困苦千般、顛連萬狀、嗚呼、造物誠何心哉、既生之而又殺之、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u005","layer":"body","order":5,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"或者疑主宰之不仁、而不知人悲之、上帝更悲之也、人爲人悲、上帝早爲人悲","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u006","layer":"body","order":6,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"也、上帝爲人悲、特不能爲人宥也、誠以患難之來、人自爲之、上帝故不能爲人","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u007","layer":"body","order":7,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"宥、人又何得疑上帝耶、夫人之所以爲人者道也理也、道存則人存、理亡斯人","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u008","layer":"body","order":8,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"亡、近世以來、爲臣者多不忠、爲子者多不孝、爲兄者多不友、爲弟者多不恭、爲","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u009","layer":"body","order":9,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"夫者多不義、爲婦者多不從、爲長者多不惠、爲幼者多不順、爲師者多不明、爲","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u010","layer":"body","order":10,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"友者多不信、士兢文藝而忽德行、農圖良田而昧心地、工作僞而弗作德、商見","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["兢","競"],"length":1,"offset":7,"reason":"此縮放度下字形近「兢」，未能確定是否為「競」字"},{"candidates":["良","艮"],"length":1,"offset":17,"reason":"字形上方點畫不清，近「艮」，可能為「良」的刻形"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u011","layer":"body","order":11,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"利而弗見義、官爲家而無報國之赤心、吏爲私而無奉公之實義、理刑名者、忘","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["忘","忈"],"length":1,"offset":33,"reason":"刻形上部與通行「忘」略異，可能是異體"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u012","layer":"body","order":12,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"善俗之遠猷、司教訓者、昧明倫之先務、僭道滅綱常而傷風化、娼優棄廉恥而","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u013","layer":"body","order":13,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"蠱愚頑、隷卒假虎威而蠹編氓、豪傑肆鯨吞而淩寡弱、雜流矜奇異而包險心、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u014","layer":"body","order":14,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"游民結黨羽而逞陰謀、邪淫者比比、奸詐者多多、腥聞在上、黑氣觸空、是以皇","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u015","layer":"body","order":15,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"天怒而災害臨、然而上帝甚愛人、殊不忍遽以災害降世、其始亦寬其限期、望","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u016","layer":"body","order":16,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"人悔過遷善、消此大難、是故春之元教人以仁、夏之亨教人以禮、秋之利教人","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u017","layer":"body","order":17,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"以義、冬之貞教人以智、日之昃、月之虧、教人以持盈而戒滿、雷之迅、風之烈、教","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u018","layer":"body","order":18,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"人以恐懼而修省、人有不明之事、斷無不報之條、如一切飢寒危難夭折之迭","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u019","layer":"body","order":19,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"見錯出者、無非欲以小懲大、以一警衆、使人人能體上帝愛人望人之心而悔","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u020","layer":"body","order":20,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"過遷善、不至大禍臨頭、如此其慘也、乃上帝愛人而人不知、上帝望人而人不","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u021","layer":"body","order":21,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"覺、惡業太重、惡類太繁、尋常災害、埽除不盡、而大患忽臨、兵戈所不及者、瘟疫","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u022","layer":"body","order":22,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"以戕之、瘟疫所不及者、旱乾水溢以戕之、嗚呼、豈上帝之本心哉、茲於大難迭","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u023","layer":"body","order":23,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"臨之餘、奉勸斯世、使人知上帝之愛人、如此其深、上帝之望人、如此其切、庶乎","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u024","layer":"body","order":24,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"惑者悟、迷者醒、速速悔過遷善、勿負造化之本心、則患難之不免於已往者、猶","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u025","layer":"body","order":25,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"可補救於將來、其遭難而死者、愛之無可愛也、是自絕也、其遇災而未至於死","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u026","layer":"body","order":26,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"者、望之猶可望也、宜自新也、其未逢禍而安享太平者、上帝厚愛之厚望之也、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u027","layer":"body","order":27,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"宜自省而自修、勿恃愛而失望、愼之愼之、一言上帝必聞也、一行上帝必見也、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u028","layer":"body","order":28,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"一念上帝必知也、人可瞞上帝不可瞞、人可欺上帝不可欺、吾心有上帝、上帝","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u029","layer":"body","order":29,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"卽在吾心、吾心時時恭敬上帝、卽時時保佑、百福並臻、千祥雲集、又何災害之","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u030","layer":"body","order":30,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"不弭、禍患之不消也、吾願有心者、其思之、其細思之、","uncertainties":[]}]}
